  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 46719365120
    m_Localized: 'Controls

      - The left paddle is controlled with W and S

      -
      The right paddle is controlled with the up and down arrow keys

      ------------------------------------------------------------

      Game
      rules

      The left paddle must score a goal in the right goal

      The
      right paddle must score a goal in the left goal

      The first to reach 9
      points wins

      -------------------------------------------------------------

      To
      start the game, press the space key'
